</div>
</div>
</details>


<!-- Designing AI - Primary -->
<details style="max-width:1000px; margin:0 auto 14px auto; font-family:ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, Segoe UI, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial; background:#FFFFFF; color:#292F36; line-height:1.6; font-size:16px;">
<summary onmouseover="this.style.background='#F2F4F7'" onmouseout="this.style.background='#FFFFFF'" style="cursor:pointer; padding:16px 24px; font-weight:800; font-size:22px; color:#141414; list-style:none; border:1px solid #e3e6ea; border-radius:16px; background:#FFFFFF; transition:background 0.2s ease;">
Designing AI
</summary>

<div style="padding:20px 24px 24px 24px;">
<div style="border-radius:18px; overflow:hidden; box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(41,47,54,0.08); border:1px solid #e3e6ea;">
<div style="background:#F4F6F8; padding:24px;">

<div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1fr; gap:20px; align-items:center; margin-bottom:20px;">

<div>
<div style="border:1px solid #dfe3e8; border-radius:18px; padding:18px; background:#FFFFFF; box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(41,47,54,0.04);">
<div style="font-weight:800; font-size:20px; margin-bottom:10px; color:#0093A4;">Original Lesson</div>
<div>Students sort objects such as animals, leaves, or shapes into categories based on observable features and explain their reasoning.</div>
</div>
</div>

<div style="width:48px; height:48px; border-radius:50%; background:#8C52BA; color:white; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:20px; font-weight:800;">→</div>

<div>
<div style="border:1px solid #dfe3e8; border-radius:18px; padding:18px; background:#FFFFFF; box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(41,47,54,0.04);">
<div style="font-weight:800; font-size:20px; margin-bottom:8px; color:#0093A4;">Small AI Shift</div>
<div>The teacher reframes the activity as “training an AI.” Students define categories, test them with new examples, and observe how different labeling choices affect results and fairness.</div>
</div>
</div>

</div>

<div style="border:1px solid #dfe3e8; border-radius:18px; padding:20px; background:#FFFFFF; box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(41,47,54,0.04);">
<div style="font-weight:800; font-size:20px; margin-bottom:16px; color:#0093A4;">Framework Connections</div>

<div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap:16px;">

<div style="display:flex; gap:10px; align-items:flex-start;">
<img src="https://images.code.org/01bcfdad34fbe94df49a42fa383600d1-Screenshot 2026-03-30 at 10.59.49 AM.png" style="width:36px; height:36px;">
<div><div style="font-weight:700;">Knowledge</div><div style="font-size:14px;">AI Reflects Human Choices and Perspectives</div></div>
</div>

<div style="display:flex; gap:10px; align-items:flex-start;">
<img src="https://images.code.org/80cec506af206a17886dd8e93fddc5ce-Screenshot 2026-03-30 at 10.59.44 AM.png" style="width:36px; height:36px;">
<div><div style="font-weight:700;">Skills</div><div style="font-size:14px;">Computational Thinking; Problem Solving</div></div>
